'''Luka Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 562
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Luka Cat
|name2 = Luka Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Luka Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat is very similar to another from the same collaboration, [[Miku Cat (Rare Cat)|Miku Cat]], but dodges attacks from Aliens instead of [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies. However, Luka Cat shouldn't be used outside of early [[Into the Future]] or early Alien [[Legend Stages]] such as [[Winning Back]] or [[Sunset Soldier]], as she has rather low survivability even with her chance to dodge.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

